{
    "version": "1.0.1",
    "description": "禁用惠普笔记本遥测驱动与后台服务，并阻止Windows更新自动重新下载安装",
    "homepage": "https://github.com/Initsnow/MyScoopBucket",
    "license": "MIT",
    "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Initsnow/MyScoopBucket/master/scripts/disable-hp-telemetry.ps1",
    "hash": "3d0d5e97cf5f09cf9c6a6f88b0ebe65e200f119e86e0286e2f3c2ca9fd536de5",
    "bin": [
        [
            "disable-hp-telemetry.ps1",
            "disable-hp-telemetry"
        ]
    ],
    "installer": {
        "script": [
            "if (Get-Command sudo -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue) {",
            "    sudo powershell.exe -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File \"$dir\\disable-hp-telemetry.ps1\" -Install -DataDir \"$persist_dir\"",
            "} else {",
            "    Start-Process powershell.exe -Verb RunAs -Wait -ArgumentList \"-NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File `\"$dir\\disable-hp-telemetry.ps1`\" -Install -DataDir `\"$persist_dir`\"\"",
            "}"
        ]
    },
    "uninstaller": {
        "script": [
            "if (Get-Command sudo -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue) {",
            "    sudo powershell.exe -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File \"$dir\\disable-hp-telemetry.ps1\" -Uninstall -DataDir \"$persist_dir\"",
            "} else {",
            "    Start-Process powershell.exe -Verb RunAs -Wait -ArgumentList \"-NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File `\"$dir\\disable-hp-telemetry.ps1`\" -Uninstall -DataDir `\"$persist_dir`\"\"",
            "}"
        ]
    },
    "persist": "data",
    "notes": [
        "已配置设备硬件阻止策略(DenyDeviceIDs)，阻止Windows更新重新安装惠普遥测驱动与组件。",
        "已停止并禁用相关遥测服务及守护任务，并配置hosts黑名单屏蔽数据上传通道。",
        "若笔记本BIOS中存在 'HP Application Driver' 选项，也可在BIOS中将其关闭以进一步隐藏底层ACPI接口。",
        "可随时在终端运行 'disable-hp-telemetry -Status' 查看遥测阻止状态。"
    ]
}
